<title>UK: Ex-dividend to take 0.385 points off FTSE Monday.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividend to take 0.385 points off FTSE Monday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stock will go ex-dividend on Monday and will take 0.385 points off the index.</p>
<p>						 DIVIDEND   INDEX</p>
<p>						 (PENCE)    EFFECT</p>
<p>		COMPANY			  Net	 Net</p>
<p>* SmithKline Beecham	     2.45	0.385</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 77717</p>
